    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531610/extras/ed35d9ae3595f4ca3579c19c44457726.poster.avif?t=1754669835\" width=752 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531610/extras/ed35d9ae3595f4ca3579c19c44457726.webm?t=1754669835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531610/extras/ed35d9ae3595f4ca3579c19c44457726.mp4?t=1754669835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stellar Raiders</strong> is a turn-based tactics roguelike where you lead a crew of space pirates, raid enemy ships, and grab as much loot as you can before making your escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minimalist Turn-Based Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, minimalist turn-based combat focused on positioning and movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No randomness\u2014outcome depends on strategy, timing, and ability use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is a small tactical puzzle: tight quarters, limited turns, and space management.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Crew</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a squad of unique raiders, each with specialized movement, perks, and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and combine abilities like pushing, pulling, swapping, cloning, and teleporting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergize unit powers to manipulate the battlefield and optimize your loot runs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Ship</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your crew, increase loot capacity, and discover stronger units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost the quality and rarity of rewards by improving key ship systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful artifacts with unique passive effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531610/extras/1ff3092bd8a6392293cc483d94b8f306.poster.avif?t=1754669835\" width=710 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531610/extras/1ff3092bd8a6392293cc483d94b8f306.webm?t=1754669835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531610/extras/1ff3092bd8a6392293cc483d94b8f306.mp4?t=1754669835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531610/extras/ed35d9ae3595f4ca3579c19c44457726.poster.avif?t=1754669835\" width=752 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531610/extras/ed35d9ae3595f4ca3579c19c44457726.webm?t=1754669835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531610/extras/ed35d9ae3595f4ca3579c19c44457726.mp4?t=1754669835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stellar Raiders</strong> is a turn-based tactics roguelike where you lead a crew of space pirates, raid enemy ships, and grab as much loot as you can before making your escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minimalist Turn-Based Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, minimalist turn-based combat focused on positioning and movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No randomness\u2014outcome depends on strategy, timing, and ability use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is a small tactical puzzle: tight quarters, limited turns, and space management.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Crew</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a squad of unique raiders, each with specialized movement, perks, and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and combine abilities like pushing, pulling, swapping, cloning, and teleporting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergize unit powers to manipulate the battlefield and optimize your loot runs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Ship</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your crew, increase loot capacity, and discover stronger units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost the quality and rarity of rewards by improving key ship systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful artifacts with unique passive effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531610/extras/1ff3092bd8a6392293cc483d94b8f306.poster.avif?t=1754669835\" width=710 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531610/extras/1ff3092bd8a6392293cc483d94b8f306.webm?t=1754669835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531610/extras/1ff3092bd8a6392293cc483d94b8f306.mp4?t=1754669835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
